"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">19</div><h1>등위접속사와 접속부사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Konjunktionen und Konnektoren</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 19의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 17 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">und·aber·oder·denn·sondern 뒤에서 어순을 그대로 둬요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">deshalb·trotzdem·sonst 같은 접속부사 뒤에서 동사를 먼저 놓아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">이유·결과·대조·추가·순서에 맞는 연결어를 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">weder … noch 같은 두 부분 접속사를 바르게 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich gehe heute nicht ins Büro, denn <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (아이가 아파서)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) krank mein Kind ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mein Kind krank ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ist mein Kind krank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) mein Kind ist krank</button></div><div class=\"qe\">denn은 등위접속사라서 자리를 차지하지 않아요.<br>뒤 문장은 평소 어순 그대로 — 주어 + 동사예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Wir haben Hunger, aber <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (냉장고가 비었어요)</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der Kühlschrank leer ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) der Kühlschrank ist leer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ist der Kühlschrank leer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) leer der Kühlschrank ist</button></div><div class=\"qe\">aber 뒤에서는 어순이 바뀌지 않아요 — der Kühlschrank ist leer.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sondern&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Sie trinkt keinen Wein, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> Wasser.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 와인이 아니라 물을 마셔요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sie trinkt keinen Wein, <b>sondern</b> Wasser.</div>앞의 kein을 바로잡을 때는 sondern이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;oder&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Gehen wir zu Fuß, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> nehmen wir ein Taxi?</div><div class=\"qko\">걸어갈까, 아니면 택시 탈까?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Gehen wir zu Fuß, <b>oder</b> nehmen wir ein Taxi?</div>둘 중 하나를 고르게 할 때는 oder예요.<br>oder 뒤의 질문도 어순 그대로예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Der Zug hat Verspätung, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> komme ich zu spät. (그래서)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) sondern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) trotzdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) deshalb</button></div><div class=\"qe\">뒤에 결과가 오고 동사가 바로 이어지니 접속부사 deshalb예요.<br>denn이면 주어가 먼저 와야 해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;komme&quot;],[&quot;ich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Ich habe meinen Schlüssel vergessen, deshalb <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(kommen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> nicht in die Wohnung.</div><div class=\"qko\">열쇠를 잊어버려서 집에 못 들어가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe meinen Schlüssel vergessen, deshalb <b>komme</b> <b>ich</b> nicht in die Wohnung.</div>deshalb가 첫 자리를 차지해요.<br>그래서 동사 komme가 둘째, 주어 ich가 그 뒤예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Es schneit stark, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> fahren wir in die Berge. (그런데도)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) deshalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) trotzdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) aber</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞 내용과 반대되는 결과는 trotzdem이에요.<br>aber·denn이면 뒤에 주어가 먼저 와야 해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sonst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Zieh eine Jacke an, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> erkältest du dich.</div><div class=\"qko\">재킷 입어, 안 그러면 감기 걸려.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Zieh eine Jacke an, <b>sonst</b> erkältest du dich.</div>'그렇지 않으면'은 sonst예요.<br>sonst가 첫 자리라 동사 erkältest가 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dann&quot;,&quot;danach&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Zuerst lesen wir den Text, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> sprechen wir darüber.</div><div class=\"qko\">먼저 글을 읽고, 그다음에 그것에 대해 이야기해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Zuerst lesen wir den Text, <b>dann</b> sprechen wir darüber.</div>순서는 dann·danach예요.<br>첫 자리를 차지해서 동사 sprechen이 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;außerdem&quot;,&quot;zudem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Das Zimmer ist ruhig, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> hat es einen Balkon.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 방은 조용하고, 게다가 발코니도 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Zimmer ist ruhig, <b>außerdem</b> hat es einen Balkon.</div>내용을 더할 때는 außerdem이에요.<br>첫 자리를 차지해서 hat es 순서가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;weder&quot;],[&quot;noch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Mein Opa hat <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ein Handy <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> einen Computer.</div><div class=\"qko\">할아버지는 휴대폰도 컴퓨터도 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Opa hat <b>weder</b> ein Handy <b>noch</b> einen Computer.</div>'~도 ~도 아니다'는 weder … noch예요.<br>이미 부정이라서 kein을 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Wir können entweder am Freitag <span class=\"qblank\"></span> am Samstag kommen. (둘 중 하루)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) oder</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) als auch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) noch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sondern</button></div><div class=\"qe\">둘 중 하나는 entweder … oder예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;als&quot;],[&quot;auch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Lena spielt sowohl Klavier <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> Gitarre.</div><div class=\"qko\">레나는 피아노도 기타도 쳐요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lena spielt sowohl Klavier <b>als</b> <b>auch</b> Gitarre.</div>'~도 ~도 (둘 다)'는 sowohl … als auch예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Er kommt nach Hause <span class=\"qblank\"></span> macht sofort den Fernseher an.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) und</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) deshalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) sondern</button></div><div class=\"qe\">뒤 문장에 주어가 없어요. 같은 주어를 뺄 수 있는 건 und·oder·aber 뒤예요.<br>denn 뒤에서는 주어를 빼지 않고, deshalb는 동사 뒤에 주어가 필요해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zwar&quot;],[&quot;aber&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Das Handy ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> alt, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> es funktioniert noch gut.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 휴대폰은 오래되긴 했지만 아직 잘 돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Handy ist <b>zwar</b> alt, <b>aber</b> es funktioniert noch gut.</div>'~이긴 하지만'은 zwar … aber예요.<br>aber 뒤는 어순 그대로 — es funktioniert.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich bleibe heute im Bett denn ich habe Fieber&quot;,&quot;Heute bleibe ich im Bett denn ich habe Fieber&quot;,&quot;Im Bett bleibe ich heute denn ich habe Fieber&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">열이 있어서 오늘은 누워 있어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">denn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Fieber</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Bett</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">bleibe</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich bleibe heute im Bett, denn ich habe Fieber.</b></div>denn 뒤 문장은 주어 + 동사 순서 그대로예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Es ist kalt trotzdem spielen die Kinder draußen&quot;,&quot;Es ist kalt die Kinder spielen trotzdem draußen&quot;,&quot;Es ist kalt draußen spielen die Kinder trotzdem&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">추운데도 아이들이 밖에서 놀아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">trotzdem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">spielen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">draußen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Kinder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">kalt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Es ist kalt, trotzdem spielen die Kinder draußen.</b></div>trotzdem이 첫 자리면 동사 spielen이 바로 와요.<br>trotzdem을 가운데 자리에 두면 도치가 없어요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Das Training beginnt nicht im März, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> im April.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) aber</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) sondern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) oder</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞의 nicht를 바로잡아 '3월이 아니라 4월'이라고 말하니 sondern이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;deshalb&quot;,&quot;deswegen&quot;,&quot;darum&quot;,&quot;also&quot;],[&quot;denn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Ich habe schlecht geschlafen, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> bin ich müde. Ich trinke viel Kaffee, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> ich muss wach bleiben.</div><div class=\"qko\">잠을 잘 못 자서 피곤해요. 깨어 있어야 해서 커피를 많이 마셔요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe schlecht geschlafen, <b>deshalb</b> bin ich müde. Ich trinke viel Kaffee, <b>denn</b> ich muss wach bleiben.</div>첫 빈칸 뒤에는 결과가 오고 동사 bin이 바로 와요 → deshalb.<br>둘째 빈칸 뒤에는 이유가 오고 주어 ich가 먼저 와요 → denn.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Bus kommt nicht deshalb gehen wir zu Fuß&quot;,&quot;Der Bus kommt nicht wir gehen deshalb zu Fuß&quot;,&quot;Der Bus kommt nicht wir gehen zu Fuß deshalb&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">버스가 안 와서 우리는 걸어가요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">gehen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">deshalb</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Fuß</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Bus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">zu</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">kommt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Bus kommt nicht, deshalb gehen wir zu Fuß.</b></div>deshalb는 첫 자리에 오면 도치, 가운데 자리에 오면 어순 그대로예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;stattdessen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Ich wollte Freunde treffen, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> habe ich zu Hause gelernt.</div><div class=\"qko\">친구들을 만나려고 했는데, 그 대신 집에서 공부했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich wollte Freunde treffen, <b>stattdessen</b> habe ich zu Hause gelernt.</div>'그 대신'은 stattdessen이에요.<br>첫 자리를 차지해서 보조 동사 habe가 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Einerseits&quot;],[&quot;andererseits&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ist das Dorf ruhig, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> gibt es dort keinen Arzt.</div><div class=\"qko\">한편으로 그 마을은 조용하지만, 다른 한편으로 거기에는 의사가 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Einerseits</b> ist das Dorf ruhig, <b>andererseits</b> gibt es dort keinen Arzt.</div>einerseits … andererseits는 둘 다 접속부사예요.<br>그래서 두 문장 모두 바로 뒤에 동사(ist · gibt)가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Ich gehe früh ins Bett, ich muss <span class=\"qblank\"></span> um fünf Uhr aufstehen. (~거든요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) deshalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) nämlich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) also</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) denn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nämlich는 이유를 덧붙이는 말로 가운데 자리에 와요.<br>denn은 문장 사이에만 오고, deshalb·also는 결과를 말해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sondern&quot;],[&quot;auch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Er ist nicht nur Koch, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> Musiker.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 요리사일 뿐 아니라 음악가이기도 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er ist nicht nur Koch, <b>sondern</b> <b>auch</b> Musiker.</div>nicht nur … sondern auch — '~뿐 아니라 ~도'예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Nimm das Geld mit sonst kannst du das Ticket nicht bezahlen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">돈 가져가, 안 그러면 표값을 낼 수 없어.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Nimm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">bezahlen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Ticket</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Geld</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">sonst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">kannst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">du</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Nimm das Geld mit, sonst kannst du das Ticket nicht bezahlen.</b></div>sonst가 첫 자리라 화법조동사 kannst가 바로 오고, 원형 bezahlen은 끝에 가요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich war krank, deshalb ich bin nicht gekommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich war krank, aber trotzdem ich bin gekommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich war krank, und deshalb bin ich nicht gekommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich war krank, denn bin ich nicht gekommen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">und는 0번 자리, deshalb가 첫 자리라서 바로 뒤에 동사 bin이 와요.<br>trotzdem 뒤에도 동사가 먼저 와야 하고, denn 뒤에서는 도치하지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 뒤 문장의 주어를 뺄 수 없는 것은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wir bleiben hier oder wir gehen ins Café.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Er steht auf und er duscht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Sie ist klein, aber sie ist stark.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Ich bin müde, denn ich habe viel gearbeitet.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">같은 주어는 und·oder·aber 뒤에서만 뺄 수 있어요.<br>denn 뒤에서는 주어를 빼지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;weder&quot;],[&quot;noch&quot;],[&quot;denn&quot;],[&quot;deshalb&quot;,&quot;deswegen&quot;,&quot;darum&quot;,&quot;also&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Mein Bruder isst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> Fleisch <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> Fisch. Er kauft sein Gemüse auf dem Markt, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> dort ist es frisch. Heute gibt es keinen Markt, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"> geht er in den Supermarkt.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 형은 고기도 생선도 먹지 않아요. 채소는 시장에서 사요, 거기 채소가 신선하기 때문이에요. 오늘은 장이 서지 않아서 슈퍼마켓에 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Bruder isst <b>weder</b> Fleisch <b>noch</b> Fisch. Er kauft sein Gemüse auf dem Markt, <b>denn</b> dort ist es frisch. Heute gibt es keinen Markt, <b>deshalb</b> geht er in den Supermarkt.</div>weder … noch로 둘 다 부정해요.<br>이유 + 어순 그대로(dort ist) → denn. 결과 + 도치(geht er) → deshalb.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Entweder du entschuldigst dich oder ich rede nicht mehr mit dir&quot;,&quot;Entweder entschuldigst du dich oder ich rede nicht mehr mit dir&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">네가 사과하든지, 아니면 나 너랑 더는 말 안 해.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Entweder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">entschuldigst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">dich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">mehr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">oder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">rede</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">dir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Entweder du entschuldigst dich, oder ich rede nicht mehr mit dir.</b></div>entweder로 시작하면 도치해도 되고 안 해도 돼요.<br>oder 뒤는 어순 그대로예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 빈칸에 들어갈 수 없는 것은? 'Der Aufzug ist kaputt, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> nehmen wir die Treppe.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) deswegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) darum</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) also</button></div><div class=\"qe\">빈칸 뒤에 동사 nehmen이 바로 와서 접속부사 자리예요. deswegen·darum·also는 모두 '그래서'예요.<br>denn은 이유를 말하고 도치를 일으키지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 어느 부분이 틀렸나요? 'Ich wollte dich anrufen, aber hatte ich keine Zeit, deshalb schreibe ich dir jetzt.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) aber hatte ich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) wollte dich anrufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) schreibe ich dir jetzt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) deshalb schreibe ich</button></div><div class=\"qe\">aber는 자리를 차지하지 않아서 도치하지 않아요 — aber ich hatte keine Zeit.<br>deshalb 뒤의 도치는 맞아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"31\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 31</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"